	)
	(text "Deadtime/mode:\n- Connected to GND through R_DT:\n	Inputs are ENx and INx, with deadtime calculated by\n		R_DT[kOhm] = 96.15 * DT[us] - 4.45\n		- ex: R_DT = 51k, DT = 570ns (from datasheet)\n- Shorted to GND: \n	Inputs are INHx and INLx, deadtime programmed in firmware\n	- Still safe if both inputs are HIGH because of interlocking"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.292 39.116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d8ea5b78-0ed6-451c-8142-c3206e365daa")
	)
